     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap CdaIVL-TSToPeriodConceptMap</b></p><a name=\"en-CdaIVL-TSToPeriodConceptMap\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcCdaIVL-TSToPeriodConceptMap\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-IVL-TS.html\">IVL_TS: Interval (V3 Data Type)</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Period\">Period</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">IVL_TS.low.value</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Period#s-Period.start\">Period.start</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>La valeur de la borne low (IVXB_TS.value) est convertie en dateTime puis affectée à Period.start.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">IVL_TS.high.value</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Period#s-Period.end\">Period.end</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>La valeur de la borne high (IVXB_TS.value) est convertie en dateTime puis affectée à Period.end.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 2 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-IVL-TS.html\">IVL_TS: Interval (V3 Data Type)</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#dateTime\">dateTime</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">IVL_TS.low.value</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#dateTime#s-dateTime\">dateTime</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td>La valeur de la borne low est utilisée comme date représentative et convertie en dateTime.</td></tr></table></div>"
